cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use SMLMAnalysis.jl, please cite it as below, together with the primary
  references for the specific methods your pipeline used (see the References page
  of the documentation).
type: software
title: "SMLMAnalysis.jl"
abstract: >-
  SMLM analysis pipeline for the JuliaSMLM ecosystem: detection, fitting, filtering,
  frame connection, drift correction, Bayesian grouping, clustering, and
  super-resolution rendering with provenance tracking.
authors:
